The artifact runs on a single commodity node. There is no cluster, GPU, or
specialized hardware requirement.

Recommended:
  - 1 node, x86-64 or arm64
  - 2 vCPUs, 2 GB RAM
  - ~200 MB free disk
  - Python 3.9+ and `pip install cryptography`

The paper's microbenchmark (C6) was collected on a commodity x86-64 Linux
machine; absolute numbers will vary with CPU but the order of magnitude
(tens to a few hundred microseconds per Ed25519 verification) is stable.
